*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% Created: 2026-11-25 22:21
*%
*% CM2320MfpClaude 1.0
*% PostScript printer description for the HP Color LaserJet CM2320 MFP series
*% (CM2320n, CM2320nf, CM2320fxi) on macOS with CUPS.
*%
*% Written for this project. The printer accepts PostScript level 3, so all
*% device features are set with setpagedevice and the printer's ColorSmart
*% operators. Features the printer cannot do itself (booklet, watermark,
*% rotate 180, letterhead mode) are done by the CM2320MfpClaude pre-filter on
*% the PDF before CUPS converts it to PostScript.
*%
*% License: MIT (see LICENSE in the project repository).
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CM2320MC.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "HP"
*Product: "(HP Color LaserJet CM2320n MFP)"
*Product: "(HP Color LaserJet CM2320nf MFP)"
*Product: "(HP Color LaserJet CM2320fxi MFP)"
*ModelName: "HP Color LaserJet CM2320 MFP CM2320MfpClaude"
*ShortNickName: "HP CLJ CM2320 CM2320MfpClaude"
*NickName: "HP Color LaserJet CM2320 MFP - CM2320MfpClaude 1.0"
*1284DeviceID: "MFG:Hewlett-Packard;MDL:HP Color LaserJet CM2320fxi MFP;CLS:PRINTER;"
*PSVersion: "(3011.001) 1"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: CMYK
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "20"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.3
*cupsLanguages: "en"
*cupsSNMPSupplies: True
*cupsPreFilter: "application/pdf 0 /Library/Printers/CM2320MfpClaude/filter/cm2320claude-prefilter"

*%==================================================================
*% Installable options
*%==================================================================
*OpenGroup: InstallableOptions/Installable Options

*OpenUI *OptionDuplexer/Duplex Unit: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *OptionDuplexer
*DefaultOptionDuplexer: True
*OptionDuplexer True/Installed: ""
*OptionDuplexer False/Not Installed: ""
*CloseUI: *OptionDuplexer

*OpenUI *OptionTray3/Tray 3: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *OptionTray3
*DefaultOptionTray3: False
*OptionTray3 True/Installed: ""
*OptionTray3 False/Not Installed: ""
*CloseUI: *OptionTray3

*CloseGroup: InstallableOptions

*UIConstraints: *OptionDuplexer False *Duplex
*UIConstraints: *Duplex *OptionDuplexer False
*UIConstraints: *OptionDuplexer False *CMBooklet
*UIConstraints: *CMBooklet *OptionDuplexer False
*UIConstraints: *OptionDuplexer False *CMLetterhead True
*UIConstraints: *CMLetterhead True *OptionDuplexer False
*UIConstraints: *OptionTray3 False *InputSlot Tray3
*UIConstraints: *InputSlot Tray3 *OptionTray3 False
*UIConstraints: *CMBooklet *CMLetterhead True
*UIConstraints: *CMLetterhead True *CMBooklet

