*%==================================================================
*% Color
*%==================================================================
*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: CMYK
*ColorModel CMYK/Color: "<</ProcessColorModel /DeviceCMYK /HWResolution [600 600]>> setpagedevice"
*ColorModel Gray/Grayscale: "<</ProcessColorModel /DeviceGray /HWResolution [600 600] /PreRenderingEnhance false>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenGroup: ColorOptions/Color Options

*OpenUI *CMEdgeControl/Edge Control: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMEdgeControl
*DefaultCMEdgeControl: Normal
*CMEdgeControl Off/Off: "globaldict /HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning known { false HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning false HPGraphicsAdaptiveHalftoning false HPImageAdaptiveHalftoning } if globaldict /HPColorTrapping known { Off HPColorTrapping } if"
*CMEdgeControl Light/Light: "globaldict /HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning known { true HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning true HPGraphicsAdaptiveHalftoning true HPImageAdaptiveHalftoning } if globaldict /HPColorTrapping known { Light HPColorTrapping } if"
*CMEdgeControl Normal/Normal: "globaldict /HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning known { true HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning true HPGraphicsAdaptiveHalftoning true HPImageAdaptiveHalftoning } if globaldict /HPColorTrapping known { Normal HPColorTrapping } if"
*CMEdgeControl Max/Maximum: "globaldict /HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning known { true HPTextAdaptiveHalftoning true HPGraphicsAdaptiveHalftoning true HPImageAdaptiveHalftoning } if globaldict /HPColorTrapping known { Max HPColorTrapping } if"
*CloseUI: *CMEdgeControl

*OpenUI *CMTextHalftone/Text Halftone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMTextHalftone
*DefaultCMTextHalftone: Smooth
*CMTextHalftone Smooth/Smooth: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { Smooth ColorSmartTextHalftone } if"
*CMTextHalftone Detail/Detail: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { Detail ColorSmartTextHalftone } if"
*CloseUI: *CMTextHalftone

*OpenUI *CMGraphicsHalftone/Graphics Halftone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMGraphicsHalftone
*DefaultCMGraphicsHalftone: Smooth
*CMGraphicsHalftone Smooth/Smooth: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { Smooth ColorSmartGraphicsHalftone } if"
*CMGraphicsHalftone Detail/Detail: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { Detail ColorSmartGraphicsHalftone } if"
*CloseUI: *CMGraphicsHalftone

*OpenUI *CMPhotoHalftone/Photo Halftone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMPhotoHalftone
*DefaultCMPhotoHalftone: Smooth
*CMPhotoHalftone Smooth/Smooth: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { Smooth ColorSmartImageHalftone } if"
*CMPhotoHalftone Detail/Detail: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { Detail ColorSmartImageHalftone } if"
*CloseUI: *CMPhotoHalftone

*OpenUI *CMTextRGB/Text RGB Color: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMTextRGB
*DefaultCMTextRGB: sRGB
*CMTextRGB sRGB/Default (sRGB): "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (MatchScreen) ColorSmartTextAdjustment } if"
*CMTextRGB Vivid/Vivid: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (Vivid) ColorSmartTextAdjustment } if"
*CMTextRGB Photo/Photo: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (PhotoQuality) ColorSmartTextAdjustment } if"
*CMTextRGB AdobeRGB/Photo (Adobe RGB 1998): "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (AdobeRGB) ColorSmartTextAdjustment } if"
*CMTextRGB None/None: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (NoAdj) ColorSmartTextAdjustment } if"
*CloseUI: *CMTextRGB

*OpenUI *CMGraphicsRGB/Graphics RGB Color: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMGraphicsRGB
*DefaultCMGraphicsRGB: sRGB
*CMGraphicsRGB sRGB/Default (sRGB): "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (MatchScreen) ColorSmartGraphicsAdjustment } if"
*CMGraphicsRGB Vivid/Vivid: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (Vivid) ColorSmartGraphicsAdjustment } if"
*CMGraphicsRGB Photo/Photo: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (PhotoQuality) ColorSmartGraphicsAdjustment } if"
*CMGraphicsRGB AdobeRGB/Photo (Adobe RGB 1998): "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (AdobeRGB) ColorSmartGraphicsAdjustment } if"
*CMGraphicsRGB None/None: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (NoAdj) ColorSmartGraphicsAdjustment } if"
*CloseUI: *CMGraphicsRGB

*OpenUI *CMPhotoRGB/Photo RGB Color: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMPhotoRGB
*DefaultCMPhotoRGB: sRGB
*CMPhotoRGB sRGB/Default (sRGB): "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (MatchScreen) ColorSmartImageAdjustment } if"
*CMPhotoRGB Vivid/Vivid: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (Vivid) ColorSmartImageAdjustment } if"
*CMPhotoRGB Photo/Photo: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (PhotoQuality) ColorSmartImageAdjustment } if"
*CMPhotoRGB AdobeRGB/Photo (Adobe RGB 1998): "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (AdobeRGB) ColorSmartImageAdjustment } if"
*CMPhotoRGB None/None: "globaldict /ColorSmartColorMatching known { (NoAdj) ColorSmartImageAdjustment } if"
*CloseUI: *CMPhotoRGB

*OpenUI *CMTextGrays/Text Neutral Grays: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMTextGrays
*DefaultCMTextGrays: Black
*CMTextGrays Black/Black Only: "globaldict /HPTextNeutralAxis known { TonerBlack HPTextNeutralAxis } if"
*CMTextGrays Process/4-Color: "globaldict /HPTextNeutralAxis known { ProcBlack HPTextNeutralAxis } if"
*CloseUI: *CMTextGrays

*OpenUI *CMGraphicsGrays/Graphics Neutral Grays: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMGraphicsGrays
*DefaultCMGraphicsGrays: Black
*CMGraphicsGrays Black/Black Only: "globaldict /HPGraphicsNeutralAxis known { TonerBlack HPGraphicsNeutralAxis } if"
*CMGraphicsGrays Process/4-Color: "globaldict /HPGraphicsNeutralAxis known { ProcBlack HPGraphicsNeutralAxis } if"
*CloseUI: *CMGraphicsGrays

*OpenUI *CMPhotoGrays/Photo Neutral Grays: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 57 AnySetup *CMPhotoGrays
*DefaultCMPhotoGrays: Process
*CMPhotoGrays Black/Black Only: "globaldict /HPImageNeutralAxis known { TonerBlack HPImageNeutralAxis } if"
*CMPhotoGrays Process/4-Color: "globaldict /HPImageNeutralAxis known { ProcBlack HPImageNeutralAxis } if"
*CloseUI: *CMPhotoGrays

*CloseGroup: ColorOptions

*%==================================================================
*% Pre-filter features (done on the PDF by cm2320claude-prefilter)
*%==================================================================
*OpenGroup: CMFinishing/Layout Extras

*% Booklet: the pre-filter imposes 2 pages per side; the code below forces
*% short-edge duplex, which a folded booklet needs.
*OpenUI *CMBooklet/Booklet: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *CMBooklet
*DefaultCMBooklet: Off
*CMBooklet Off/Off: ""
*CMBooklet LeftBinding/Left Binding: "<</Duplex true /Tumble true>> setpagedevice"
*CMBooklet RightBinding/Right Binding: "<</Duplex true /Tumble true>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *CMBooklet

*% Letterhead mode: single-sided jobs also go through the duplex path, so
*% preprinted paper is loaded the same way for 1- and 2-sided jobs.
*OpenUI *CMLetterhead/Letterhead Mode: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *CMLetterhead
*DefaultCMLetterhead: False
*CMLetterhead False/Off: ""
*CMLetterhead True/On: "<</Duplex true>> setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *CMLetterhead

*OpenUI *CMRotate180/Rotate 180 Degrees: Boolean
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *CMRotate180
*DefaultCMRotate180: False
*CMRotate180 False/Off: ""
*CMRotate180 True/On: ""
*CloseUI: *CMRotate180

*OpenUI *CMWmText/Watermark: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *CMWmText
*DefaultCMWmText: Off
*CMWmText Off/Off: ""
*CMWmText Draft/DRAFT: ""
*CMWmText Confidential/CONFIDENTIAL: ""
*CMWmText Copy/COPY: ""
*CMWmText Sample/SAMPLE: ""
*CMWmText Internal/INTERNAL: ""
*CMWmText DoNotCopy/DO NOT COPY: ""
*CloseUI: *CMWmText

*OpenUI *CMWmPages/Watermark Pages: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *CMWmPages
*DefaultCMWmPages: All
*CMWmPages All/All Pages: ""
*CMWmPages First/First Page Only: ""
*CloseUI: *CMWmPages

*OpenUI *CMWmIntensity/Watermark Intensity: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 60 AnySetup *CMWmIntensity
*DefaultCMWmIntensity: Medium
*CMWmIntensity Light/Light: ""
*CMWmIntensity Medium/Medium: ""
*CMWmIntensity Dark/Dark: ""
*CloseUI: *CMWmIntensity

*CloseGroup: CMFinishing

*%==================================================================
*% Fonts: the printer has the standard 35 PostScript fonts; CUPS embeds
*% the fonts of the document, so no font list is needed here.
*%==================================================================
*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
*Font Helvetica: Standard "(001.006S)" Standard ROM
*Font Times-Roman: Standard "(001.007S)" Standard ROM
*Font Symbol: Special "(001.007S)" Special ROM
*% End of CM2320MfpClaude.ppd
